@div segment E

E.1. lu₂# URUD# HA# RI# X# IN# [...] šag₄# [...] BA X X [...]
#lem: lu[person]; X; X; X; X; X; X; šag[heart]; X; X; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=E.1

