E.2. {d}amar-{d}suen# lugal# <nam>-tar-ra#-ni šag₄-bi X nu-mu-un-ba-ba
?#tr.en: He who …….
?#tr.en: King @wRN{Amar-@wDN{Suena}} has not been assigned a fate from (?) it.
